essor/\" data-discover=\"true\">Try it free — no signup</a></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"faq-container\"><h2 class=\"faq-title\">Common questions</h2><div class=\"faq-list\"><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary class=\"faq-q\">Do my files get uploaded to a server?</summary><p class=\"faq-a\">No. All compression, resizing, and conversion runs entirely in your browser using the HTML5 Canvas API. Your images never leave your device — no server, no cloud, no logs.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary class=\"faq-q\">How does the exact KB target work?</summary><p class=\"faq-a\">We use a binary-search algorithm that compresses your image repeatedly at different quality levels until the output lands just under your target. Unlike tools where you guess a quality slider, ours hits the number automatically.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary class=\"faq-q\">Which formats are supported?</summary><p class=\"faq-a\">Input: JPEG, PNG, WebP, BMP. Output: JPEG, PNG, or WebP. You can also convert formats in the same step — e.g. compress a WebP and save it as a JPG.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary class=\"faq-q\">Is there a file size or daily usage limit?</summary><p class=\"faq-a\">No limits at all. Files of any size, as many times as you want, every day. Completely free, forever. We earn from non-intrusive ads.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary class=\"faq-q\">Why is this better than TinyPNG?</summary><p class=\"faq-a\">TinyPNG uploads your file to their servers. We process everything locally in your browser, so nothing is ever sent anywhere. You also get exact KB targeting, which TinyPNG doesn't offer.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"cta-section\"><div class=\"cta-inner\"><h2 class=\"cta-title\">Start compressing — it's free</h2><p class=\"cta-sub\">Images, PDFs, instant results. No account. No upload. No limits.</p><div class=\"cta-btns\"><a class=\"btn-primary b